                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-4">
                                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fa fa-check text-success mr-2"></i> Separated by color</li>
                                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fa fa-check text-success mr-2"></i> Premium detergents</li>
                                    <li class="mb-2"><i class="fa fa-check text-success mr-2"></i> crisply folded</li>
                                </ul>
                                <a href="/pricing" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4">See Pricing</a>
